      LESSON 15
LESSON 15: WORKSPACES

A WORKSPACE IS EVERYTHING YOU HAVE: THE VARIABLES AND THE
FUNCTIONS, THE SETTINGS, AND WHERE THE RANDOM SEQUENCE
STANDS. )WSID SAYS ITS NAME, )VARS AND )FNS LIST WHAT IS IN
IT, AND )WSID NAME RENAMES IT. TRY:

      )WSID
      )VARS
      )WSID MINE

THE LESSON MACHINERY IS THERE TOO; ITS NAMES BEGIN WITH A
DELTA SO THAT THEY SORT AFTER YOURS.
(TRY IT. TYPE GO TO GO ON, OR STOP TO LEAVE.)
⎕:
      )WSID
COURSE
⎕:
      )VARS
GO LAST STOP
⎕:
      )WSID MINE
WAS COURSE
⎕:
      GO
)SAVE WRITES THE WORKSPACE UNDER ITS NAME INTO LIBRARY 0,
YOURS, AND )LIB LISTS WHAT IS THERE. )DROP NAME REMOVES ONE.
TRY:

      )SAVE
      )LIB

THE FILE IS PLAIN TEXT, AND IT IS APL: LOADING IT RUNS IT.
ONE THING IS NOT SAVED: A FUNCTION STOPPED PART WAY, AS
OOPS WAS IN LESSON 14. WHAT IS SAVED IS WHAT YOU WOULD HAVE
WHEN EVERY FUNCTION HAD RETURNED.
(TRY IT. TYPE GO TO GO ON, OR STOP TO LEAVE.)
⎕:
      )SAVE
6.54.59 09/26/26 MINE
⎕:
      )LIB
MINE
⎕:
      GO
)LOAD NAME REPLACES YOUR WORKSPACE WITH THE SAVED ONE,
SETTINGS AND ALL. )COPY NAME OBJECT BRINGS ONE THING INTO
THE WORKSPACE YOU HAVE, KEEPING YOUR SETTINGS. )CLEAR GIVES
AN EMPTY ONE, CALLED CLEAR WS. TRY:

      )ERASE HELLO
      )COPY 2 COURSE HELLO
      HELLO

)LOAD AND )CLEAR END THE LESSON, OF COURSE: THEY REPLACE THE
WORKSPACE IT IS RUNNING IN. THE COPY CAME FROM LIBRARY 2,
WHERE THIS COURSE LIVES.
(TRY IT. TYPE GO TO GO ON, OR STOP TO LEAVE.)
⎕:
      )ERASE HELLO
⎕:
      )COPY 2 COURSE HELLO
SAVED 11.00.00 09/25/26
⎕:
      HELLO
HELLO.
⎕:
      GO
A LIBRARY IS A NUMBERED PLACE FOR WORKSPACES: 0 IS YOURS,
1 IS WHAT SW-APL SHIPS, AND 2 IS THIS COURSE AND ITS
COMPANIONS. )LIBS LISTS THE LIBRARIES, )LIB N LISTS ONE, AND
)LOAD N NAME LOADS FROM ONE. EVERY WORKSPACE IN 1 AND 2 HAS
A DESCRIBE THAT SAYS WHAT IT HOLDS: LOADING ONE PRINTS ONLY
WHEN IT WAS SAVED, AND DESCRIBE IS WHAT YOU TYPE NEXT. TRY:

      )LIBS
      )LIB 2

WHEN THIS LESSON ENDS, TRY )LOAD MINE, )DROP MINE, AND
DESCRIBE AGAIN.

END OF LESSON 15. TYPE QUIZ 15 TO CHECK, OR NEXT TO GO ON.
      )LIBS
0 USER
1 CORE
2 EXTENDED
      )LIB 2
COURSE
DRILL
